   "text": "Fisher College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nFisher College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nFor more than 100 years, Fisher College has been changing the lives of its students by offering flexible entry requirements and giving them the tools and experiences they need to successfully achieve their career goals. \nLocated in the heart of Boston’s prestigious Back Bay neighborhood, Fisher educates students in the exciting, thriving environment of one of the most historic cities in the US. But while the city may be large, Fisher College is comfortably small – a campus where you’ll benefit from the personal attention of a 14:1 student-to-faculty ratio. Together, this delivers a rare educational environment offering the personal attention of a small college combined with the excitement and opportunities only a city like Boston can provide. \nTimestamps\nUpdated\n13/11/2025 08:46\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n29/10/2025 07:48\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$46,860.00\nMin: US$27,342.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n9%\n150 of 1,662 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nINTO\nFounded Year\n1903\nCampus(es)\nBoston\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\nN/A\nContract End Date\nN/A\nContract Entity\nN/A\nContract Status\n-\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.fisher.edu/student-life/housing\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.fisher.edu/admissions-aid/financial-aid\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/FisherCollegeBoston\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
